2. AUTHENTICATION SYSTEM
------------------------
- BCrypt for password hashing (cost factor: 10)
- JWT tokens for session management
- Two-token system:
  * Auth token (1 hour expiry)
  * Refresh token (7 days expiry)
- Tokens stored in HTTP-only cookies

3. LOGIN FEATURE
----------------
- Login with email OR custom string ID
- Checks users in order: OrderReceiver → StockManager → Admin
- Redirects to role-specific dashboard:
  * Admin → /admin
  * StockManager → /stock_manager
  * OrderReceiver → /order_receiver

4. ROLE-BASED ACCESS CONTROL
----------------------------
- Admin: Can manage everything
- StockManager: Can manage inventory and purchases
- OrderReceiver: Can manage orders

Each role has its own:
- Base controller with authentication check
- Dashboard controller
- Dashboard view

5. TOKEN REFRESH
----------------
- Frontend intercepts 401 responses
- Automatically calls /refresh endpoint
- Retries original request after refresh
- Redirects to login if refresh fails

